* Classroom educational MOS library v1; long-channel LEVEL=1, not a PDK.
* Baseline cards preserve the original 5T OTA coefficients.
* SI W/L with explicit suffixes; never apply scale=1u to these instances.
* KP: A/V^2; TOX: m; CGSO/CGDO: F/m; LAMBDA: 1/V.
* KF defaults to 0, AF to 1; demonstrate flicker with deck-local overrides.
.model NMOS_EDU NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=200u LAMBDA=0.03
+ GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7 TOX=20n CGSO=200p CGDO=200p)
.model PMOS_EDU PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=80u LAMBDA=0.04
+ GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7 TOX=20n CGSO=200p CGDO=200p)
